      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Erva de Algodão. Hoppip é levado pelo vento por distâncias enormes. Não se sabe de onde vieram originalmente os Hoppip de Paldea. Fora das regiões frias, eles podem ser encontrados em praticamente todo lugar, pois o vento transporta a espécie pelo mundo inteiro.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada, Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Hoppip pode evoluir para Skiploom no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Absorb, Splash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Synthesis, Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Fairy Wind, Poison Powder</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Stun Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Sleep Powder</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Bullet Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Mega Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Acrobatics</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Rage Powder</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Cotton Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>U-turn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Worry Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Bounce, Giga Drain, Memento</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Attract, Baton Pass, Bounce, Bullet Seed, Charm, Confide, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Double-Edge, Encore, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fling, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Infestation, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Lunge, Magical Leaf, Pollen Puff, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Round, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Tailwind, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trailblaze, U-turn, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Aromatherapy, Confusion, Cotton Guard, Double-Edge, Encore, Endure, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Rage Powder, Seed Bomb, Strength Sap, Switcheroo, Worry Seed</p>",
